      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4072840467",
      "Source": "[PU] Eclipse Fragment",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]蚀影碎片","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1792949101",
      "Source": "A piece of solidified shadow, the Eclipse Fragment captures the fleeting moment when light and darkness collide. Its surface shifts between gleaming black and faint silver, embodying the duality of the eclipse. This fragment is imbued with the power to manipulate light and shadow, a vital resource for forging weapons and armor that harness the balance between the two.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"凝固暗影结晶，蚀影碎片封存了光明与黑暗相撞的刹那一瞬，体表流转暗银光泽，掌控光影之力，是打造光暗系装备的核心材料.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2733414536",
