      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2184362905",
      "Source": "An ancient and powerful relic, the Elemental Rune is inscribed with runes that glow with the raw, primal forces of fire, ice, and lightning. The rune’s rugged surface bears the marks of countless battles and the elemental energies it has contained over the ages. One side of the rune pulses with fiery reds and oranges, while another crackles with icy blues, and a third hums with electric yellows. This relic holds the essence of titanic power, representing the elemental forces that shaped the world. Only by offering the Elemental Rune can one hope to tame the mighty creatures of the Ragnarok Tier, who recognize and respect the elemental strength it represents.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"上古强力古物，铭刻冰火雷三大原始元素纹路，历经战火侵染蕴藏无尽元素之力，是驯服诸神层级生物的必备信物.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
