      "Source": "A shimmering, translucent substance that pulses with otherworldly energy. Ethereal Essence holds the power of the unseen, a remnant of the forgotten gods that once ruled the ethereal planes. Its mystical aura can bend the fabric of reality, making it a rare and invaluable component for crafting items that defy the physical world.",
