    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1475876959",
      "Source": "[PU] Evershade Shard",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]永暗碎片","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::20325092",
      "Source": "Forged in the forgotten realms, the Evershade Shard is a relic of immense power and ancient origin. This jagged, dark crystalline shard is infused with swirling patterns of deep purple and blue, its surface fragmented yet reflective. Tiny wisps of ghostly energy escape from its cracks, hinting at the boundless void it contains. The shard carries the weight of oblivion, a constant reminder of things lost to time. To tame the powerful and elusive creatures of the Oblivion Tier, one must wield the Evershade Shard, as it resonates with the eternal darkness that dwells within them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"异界原始至宝，暗紫色幽蓝纹路交织，缝隙逸散虚空虚无，承载遗忘之力，是驯服遗忘层级生物的核心信物.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
