    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2445189972",
      "Source": "[PU] Guide Note",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]进阶指南备注","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3693077546",
      "Source": "Void Dino = Void Resources\\nElementium Dino = Elementium Resources\\nMithril Dino = Mithril Resources\\nUnobtanium Dino = Unobtanium Resources\\nEternium Dino = Eternium Resources\\nBeta unlocks Gamma\\nGamma unlocks Elemental & Elementium\\nElemental unlocks Apex\\nApex unlocks Mystic & Mithril\\nMystic unlocks Phantom\\nPhantom unlocks Neon & Unobtanium\\nNeon unlocks Nebula\\nNebula unlocks Chaos & Eternium\\nChaos unlocks Infinity\\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"虚空恐龙产出虚空资源 | 混元恐龙产出混元资源 | 秘银恐龙产出秘银资源 | 超导恐龙产出超导资源 | 以太恐龙产出以太资源 | 贝塔解锁伽马品级 | 伽马解锁元素、混元品级 | 元素解锁顶尖品级 | 顶尖解锁神秘、秘银品级 | 神秘解锁虚幻品级 | 虚幻解锁霓虹、超导品级 | 霓虹解锁星云品级 | 星云解锁混沌、以太品级 | 混沌解锁无尽品级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
