    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4294857262",
      "Source": "[PU] Shadowlight Bloom",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]幽光花蕊","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1202054468",
      "Source": "A rare and exquisite flower that captures the moment of an eclipse in its petals. The Shadowlight Bloom displays a sharp contrast between brilliant golden light and deep shadowy darkness, perfectly balanced yet distinct. The flower emits a faint glow, and its delicate petals seem to ripple with both light and shadow. This bloom is steeped in mystery, reflecting the duality of day and night, light and dark. Creatures of the Eclipse Tier, who embody this duality, are irresistibly drawn to the bloom’s unique energy, making it the key to their taming.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"珍稀奇花，花瓣封存日食光影，金光与暗影泾渭分明、共生一体，花瓣微光流转.蕴藏昼夜明暗二元之力，蚀影系生物受其能量吸引，是驯养该品级生物的专属饲料.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
