      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1350078463",
      "Source": "[PU] Spiritfruit Essence",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]灵果精华","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2522097931",
      "Source": "A rare and mystical fruit that seems to exist between the physical world and the ethereal plane. Spiritfruit Essence glows with a soft, otherworldly light, shifting between pale blues, purples, and silvers. The fruit is light as air, almost weightless in your hand, and has a smooth, glass-like texture. When consumed, it resonates with the very essence of the ethereal, granting a deep connection to the spirits and energies of the unseen world. Creatures of the Ethereal Tier are drawn to this fruit, sensing the ethereal power it contains, and will only submit to those who offer it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种稀有的神秘果实，仿佛存在于物质世界与以太位面之间，泛着蓝紫银渐变柔光，质地如琉璃、轻盈无重.内含虚无原始，虚无生物被其吸引，是驯养虚无品级生物的必需品.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
