    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::519132553",
      "Source": "[PU] Voidheart Root",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[PU]虚空根茎","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::305868264",
      "Source": "Born from the deepest, darkest recesses of the abyss, the Voidheart Root is a formidable and ominous item. Its surface is rough and jagged, with deep, blood-red veins pulsing with malevolent energy. The root emanates a cold, foreboding aura, as if it harbors the darkness of the abyss itself. Holding it sends a shiver down your spine, as though you can feel the pull of the void. This dark and potent root is the only food capable of taming the powerful and fearsome creatures of the Abyssal Tier, who sense the abyssal energy coursing through it and are compelled by its dark allure.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"诞生于深渊至暗深处的诡谲道具，表皮凹凸嶙峋，暗红脉络涌动邪能，散发刺骨阴冷气场，裹挟深渊原始黑暗.手持此物心生寒意，受虚空之力牵引.是唯一可驯服深渊阶位的饲料，深渊生灵会被其深渊能量蛊惑驯服","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
