    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2463251580",
      "Source": "A dark, pulsating sphere of condensed energy, the Abyssal Core radiates a cold, malevolent force that seems to devour the light around it. This core is the heart of the abyss, a fragment of pure darkness drawn from the deepest depths of the forgotten realms. It's essential for creating items infused with the power of the void, where only the most daring survivors dare to tread.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"凝聚深渊邪能的暗黑色脉动球体，散发吞噬光芒的阴冷之力，取自遗忘深渊原始，是锻造虚空系装备的核心素材","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
